A version file named as a minor version whose schema is not backward
compatible with its predecessor's: one error for each field it narrows.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	size:  "s" | "m" | "l"
	count: string | int
}
-- ship/history/0.1.thema --
Schema: {
	size:  "s" | "m"
	count: string
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	size:  "s" | "m"
	count: string
}
-- out/error --
error[E0215]: count in history/0.1.thema was int and is now string
 --> history/0.1.thema:3:2
  |
3 |     count: string
  |     ^^^^^
  |
  = note: 0.1 is a minor version, so it must accept all data 0.0 accepts
  = help: make the change compatible, or rename the file history/1.0.thema

error[E0215]: size in history/0.1.thema is now "s" | "m", which has no alternative for the prior "l"
 --> history/0.1.thema:2:2
  |
2 |     size:  "s" | "m"
  |     ^^^^
  |
  = note: 0.1 is a minor version, so it must accept all data 0.0 accepts
  = help: make the change compatible, or rename the file history/1.0.thema
